Dates</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin : <strong>03/08/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>07/09/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <b>07/09/2026</b></li>\n<li>Correction Date : <strong>08/09/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Eligibility Result Available : <strong>As per Schedule</strong></li>\n<li>Exam Date :<span style=\"color: #000000\"><b> October 2026 (Tentative)&nbsp;</b></span></li>\n<li>Exam City Available : <strong>Before Exam</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>Before Exam</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%;height: 250px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>General (UR) / OBC / EWS : <b>185/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <b>95/-</b></li>\n<li>PH (Divyang) : <b>25/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through UPI, Debit Card, Credit Card and Net Banking Mode Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 182px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%;height: 182px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>UPSSSC PET Online Form 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Age Limit as on 01/07/2026</b></span></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>18 Years</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>40 Years&nbsp;</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per Uttar Pradesh UPSSSC PET Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 44px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%;height: 44px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>UPSSSC PET Exam 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Eligibility Details</b></span></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 29.103%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"3\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 23.6689%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"7\"><strong>UPSSSC PET 2026&nbsp; Eligibility</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 162px\">\n<td style=\"width: 29.103%;text-align: center;height: 162px\" colspan=\"3\">Pre Examination Test UPSSSC PET 2026<p></p>\n<p>Score Card Valid : 3 Years</p></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6689%;text-align: center;height: 162px\" colspan=\"7\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Minimum Class 10 High School Exam in Any Recognized Board OR Any Higher Qualification in Any Recognized University in India.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">For More Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 401px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%;height: 401px\" colspan=\"10\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>UPSSSC Preliminary Examination Test PET Examination 2026. Candidate can apply online from <strong>03 August 2026 to 07 September 2026</strong>.</li>\n<li>UPSSSC PET 2026 Score Card Valid : 3 Years.</li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Examination Application Form in UPSSSC Preliminary Examination Test PET Examination 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%;height: 104px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full UPSSSC PET 2026 Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px\">\n<td sty